Hi Avery,

What's new in Ashby this month:

Interview plans
Define the stages, interviewers and scorecards for a role once, and every candidate in that pipeline follows the same plan. Deviations are flagged.

Structured debriefs
Debriefs now pull every scorecard into one view with a summary of where interviewers agreed and disagreed, so the meeting is about the disagreements.

Sourcing extension
The new browser extension adds candidates from LinkedIn and GitHub to a pipeline in one click and de-duplicates against your existing database.

Also: offer-letter templates with e-signature, and a redesigned analytics page for time-to-hire by stage.

See the release notes: https://ashbyhq.com/changelog/march-2026

